   "text": "Thank you, Helen. You're verified.\n\nI can't issue a refund or credit for the pad see ew myself right now. Your account has had several recent support refunds, and that triggers a mandatory review. While the review is open, I can't issue any compensation on the account.\n\nI've passed your case to a specialist and included the missing pad see ew from order #9601. They'll follow up with you within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n\nI'm sorry for the inconvenience."
