   "text": "Yes. The escalation (reference ESC-700) is filed against order #9601 and names the missing pad see ew ($13.00). A specialist will follow up within 24 hours.\n\nI understand the wait is frustrating, especially as a Plus member. Plus gives higher limits, but it doesn't change the account review, and that applies to every account the same way.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
