   "text": "I checked order #9602. The delivery log shows the courier's account was suspended mid-delivery and the order was never handed over, so it was lost on our side. I'm sorry about that.\n\nNormally a lost order is refunded in full or replaced. Because of the open account review, I can't issue either one myself right now. I've added #9602 to the review as a separate escalation (reference ESC-701), next to the one for #9601 (ESC-700). I noted that the order never arrived and that you'd like both handled together. A specialist will follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise the outcome.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
